            "TypeKey": "Hmi.Text",
            "X": 64.0,
            "Y": 516.0,
            "Width": 700.0,
            "Height": 28.0,
            "Rotation": 0.0,
            "ZIndex": 11,
            "IsLocked": false,
            "Properties": {
              "Text": "本方案的四条测量口径",
              "Foreground": "#FF93C5FD",
              "FontSize": "16",
              "FontWeight": "SemiBold",
              "TextAlignment": "Left",
              "VerticalContentAlignment": "Center"
            },
            "Bindings": [],
            "EventHooks": [],
            "Animations": []
          },
          {
            "ElementId": "787d8a7b-228a-476f-8e5f-9faedcd359fa",
            "Name": "说明正文",
            "LayerId": "854fadeb-bae6-93bc-3b0c-bc39f9bb1fa6",
            "GroupId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
            "ParentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
            "TemplateId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
            "TemplateIndex": -1,
            "TemplateRevision": 0,
            "TypeKey": "Hmi.Text",
            "X": 64.0,
            "Y": 552.0,
            "Width": 1780.0,
            "Height": 230.0,
            "Rotation": 0.0,
            "ZIndex": 11,
            "IsLocked": false,
            "Properties": {
              "Text": "1) 当量只有一个来源：M_Calib 的 MmPerPixel 接到四路卡尺的 MmPerPixel 端口，卡尺不再手填；未接上游时才回落手填 PixelSizeMm，避免「一半手填一半上游」的静默错数。\n2) 卡尺矩形必须横跨被测边：半长 L1 沿扫描方向（Phi 方向），边缘垂直于它；半宽 L2 垂直于 Phi，是卡尺阵列均布方向。L1 太小或 Phi 转 90° 都检不到边。\n3) 判定在插件内做：每路卡尺自带 StandardValue / Upper / LowerTolerance，输出的 IsOk 直接落变量，流程只做「四路全过」的逻辑与，不在流程里重复写公差比较。\n4) CPK 用极差法：σ ≈ R / d2（n=2 取 1.128），单件测量站够用；量产请换 X-bar-R 图或直接读 SPC 数据库。",
              "Foreground": "#FFE2E8F0",
              "FontSize": "13",
              "TextAlignment": "Left",
              "VerticalContentAlignment": "Top",
              "TextWrapping": "Wrap"
            },
            "Bindings": [],
            "EventHooks": [],
            "Animations": []
          },
